rg/groups/vulnerability\">Vulnerability</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/groups/web\">Web</a>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"links\">\n    <div class=\"about\">Projects</div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     (<a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/\">overview</a>, <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/archive\">archive</a>)\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/amber\">Amber</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/babylon\">Babylon</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/brisbane\">Brisbane</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/crac\">CRaC</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/code-tools\">Code Tools</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/coin\">Coin</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/cvmi\">Common VM Interface</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/detroit\">Detroit</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/guide\">Developers' Guide</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/duke\">Duke</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/icedtea\">IcedTea</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/jdk8u\">JDK 8 Updates</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/jdk9\">JDK 9</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/jdk\">JDK</a> (…, <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/jdk/26\">26</a>, <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/jdk/27\">27</a>, <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/jdk/28\">28</a>)\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/jdk-updates\">JDK Updates</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/jmc\">JMC</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/jigsaw\">Jigsaw</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/lanai\">Lanai</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/leyden\">Leyden</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/lilliput\">Lilliput</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/loom\">Loom</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/jmm\">Memory Model Update</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/mlvm\">Multi-Language VM</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/nashorn\">Nashorn</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/nio\">New I/O</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/openjfx\">OpenJFX</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/panama\">Panama</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/aarch32-port\">Port: AArch32</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/aarch64-port\">Port: AArch64</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/bsd-port\">Port: BSD</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/haiku-port\">Port: Haiku</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/mips-port\">Port: MIPS</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/mobile\">Port: Mobile</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/ppc-aix-port\">Port: PowerPC/AIX</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/riscv-port\">Port: RISC-V</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/s390x-port\">Port: s390x</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/sctp\">SCTP</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/shenandoah\">Shenandoah</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/skara\">Skara</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/sumatra\">Sumatra</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/tsan\">Tsan</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/valhalla\">Valhalla</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/wakefield\">Wakefield</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/zero\">Zero</a>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"link\">\n     <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/projects/zgc\">ZGC</a>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"buttons\">\n    <a href=\"https://oracle.com\"><img alt=\"Oracle logo\" src=\"https://openjdk.org/images/oracle.svg\"></a>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div id=\"footer\">\n   © 2026 Oracle Corporation and/or its affiliates\n   <br>\n   <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/legal/tou/\">Terms of Use</a> · License: <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/legal/gplv2+ce.html\">GPLv2</a> · <a href=\"https://www.oracle.com/us/legal/privacy/\">Privacy</a> · <a href=\"https://openjdk.org/legal/openjdk-trademark-notice.html\">Trademarks</a>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "JEP 541 提议弃用 OpenJDK 的 macOS/x64 端口，旨在未来版本中将其移除以降低维护成本。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "JEP 541 提议弃用 OpenJDK 的 macOS/x64 端口，旨在未来版本中将其移除以降低维护成本。",
  "summary": "JEP 541 由 Mikael Vidstedt 提交，概述了一个计划，即弃用 JDK 的 macOS/x64 端口，意图在未来版本中将其移除。Apple 向 AArch64 硬件的过渡使得维护 x64 端口成为 Oracle 工程师的重大负担。该提案详细说明，除非提供新的 --enable-deprecated-ports 标志，否则尝试配置 macOS/x64 构建将产生错误；该标志仅会产生警告，且不保证构建成功或功能正常。该端口将在 JDK 仓库的 GitHub Actions 中默认禁用，以免阻碍主线开发，相关文档将标记其为已弃用以便移除。JEP 指出，如果在集成之前或之后有一个可信的开发者团队承诺维护该端口，则该弃用可以被撤销或恢复，这遵循了之前端口弃用的先例。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "macOS/x64 端口将被弃用，并在未来的 JDK 版本中可能被移除。",
      "explanation": "Apple 向 AArch64 硬件的过渡使得维护 x64 端口成本高昂，促使 Oracle 计划从 JDK 27 开始移除该端口。"
    },
    {
      "point": "除非使用 --enable-deprecated-ports 标志，否则构建 macOS/x64 将触发错误；该标志仅会显示警告。",
      "explanation": "configure 脚本默认会阻止构建，需要显式选择才能继续，且该端口不保证能够工作或获得支持。"
    },
    {
      "point": "如果开发者在 JEP 集成之前或之后承诺维护该端口，则该弃用可被撤销。",
      "explanation": "与之前的端口弃用一样，有兴趣的维护者可以介入以保持该端口存活，从而可能撤销或恢复该 JEP。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "弃用 macOS/x64 端口，意图在未来版本中将其移除，以降低维护成本。",
    "尝试配置 macOS/x64 构建将产生： ... configure: error: macOS/x64 端口已被弃用，并可能在未来版本中被移除。使用 --enable-deprecated-ports 以抑制此错误。"
  ],
